# Cloudspire Skycycle (Vehicle 2/3, flying, Crew 1): "when this Vehicle enters, distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two other target Vehicles
# and/or creatures you control" (CR 601.2d). On turn one Bot1 casts one with Black Lotus and Mox Pearl: Memnite is the only other legal
# target, so it takes both counters (a share of one, or of three, is refused). On turn three a second Skycycle (Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl, Plains,
# Mountain) has two targets, the Memnite and the first Skycycle, an uncrewed Vehicle and so not a creature: one counter on each (a total of three is refused;
# the Skycycle itself is not offered). On turn five a third one, with three other targets in play, puts both counters on the Skycycle that
# is the one target chosen ("one or two": one is enough).

